 "id": 1326648,
 "titulo": "v470 Update Details #2 (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1546984800000,
 "modificada": 1733110561859,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1326648",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/eeeuPdate.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">CM Debris here with&nbsp;the second half of our January update!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">To welcome MARVEL’s&nbsp;<strong>[Fantastic Four: World's Greatest Week],</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Marvel’s First Family, the Fantastic Four, Latverian champion Victorious, and Doctor Doom, a super villain with genius-level intellect, have arrived in MARVEL Future Fight!<br>\nWatch them compete in a variety of stages!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Get ready for MARVEL Future Fight’s January update!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">The Fantastic Four and their foes Doctor Doom and Victorious are joining the battle!<br>\n6 New Characters have been added!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Fantastic Four-themed uniforms have been added as well! <strong>Crystal and She-Hulk’s Fantastic Four Uniforms are here</strong>!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">To support a hero fighting tirelessly against monsters, <strong>Moon Girl’s Monster’s Unleashed! Uniform has now been added! </strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">3 New Uniforms have been added!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">9 more Characters can now realize their inner Potential</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">To demonstrate <strong>Mister Fantastic’s</strong> strong leadership skills, <strong>his Tier-3 Skill will also be available after the update!</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">A new Epic Quest which <strong>highlights the story of Fantastic Four </strong>has also been added!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Enjoy the first update of 2019!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">6 New Characters Added!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">After a long wait, the legendary Fantastic Four and two villains who have threatened the world for a long time have arrived!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Mister Fantastic / Invisible Woman / Human Torch / The Thing / Doctor Doom and Victorious </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">have arrived.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/mister.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/invi.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/hum.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/thng.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/vict.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/doom.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* The Skill descriptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">3 New Uniforms Added!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Fantastic Four-themed uniforms </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Crystal and She-Hulk </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">are here to support the Fantastic 4. </span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">A new uniform for <strong>Moon Girl </strong>has been added to help her teammates repel the upcoming monster invasion.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/uni.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; color: red;\">* The Skill descriptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; color: red;\">* 3 new uniforms will be on sale during the event period. You can check them out on the Marvel Universe menu and by going to the Uniform Room.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> 9 More Characters Can Now Realize Their Potential</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;\">With the January update, you can now realize the Potential of the following characters:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Mister Fantastic, Invisible Woman, Human Torch, The Thing, Doctor Doom, and Victorious.</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Lastly, <strong>Crystal, She-Hulk, and Moon Girl</strong> can also realize their Potential! Unlock their potential and raise their level to 70!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082052/2num0.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> New Tier-3 Upgrade</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">The proud leader of the Fantastic Four, Mister Fantastic’s Tier-3 upgrade is included in our January update!</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Check below to see how his elastic powers have been enhanced by combining his genius-level intellect!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"Animated GIF\" src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/3bb5p2Mb6ryfeJ5qEj/giphy.gif\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082126/t3.png\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> New Epic Quest: First Family added</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">A new stage where the story of our new characters takes place!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">This is an Epic Quest where you can get and learn more about the Fantastic Four!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Epic Quest: First Family has been added.&nbsp; </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">By playing Epic Quest: First Family, you can get Mister Fantastic right away!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num1.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">By playing the Epic Quest even more, you can learn about the story of the Fantastic Four, make Mister Fantastic stronger, and acquire more Fantastic Four members!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num2.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-fareast-language: JA;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Join and acquire both The Thing and Human Torch by playing Fantastic 4’s story!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Upon purchasing the <strong>Epic Quest: First Family Deluxe Package</strong>, you can earn <strong>extra rewards</strong> and <strong>play exclusive missions.</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num3.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong>[2020 5/8 7:45 a.m. (UTC+0) / 2020 5/8 12:45 a.m. (PDT) added]</strong><br>\n* Epic Quest Deluxe Package will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refuned.<br>\n* The available special stages after using the Epic Quest Deluxe Package can be used continuously.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Lastly, if you’ve upgraded the required characters from Epic Quest to Level 60, 6</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">★</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">, 6</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">★</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-language: JA;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"> Mastery, and Tier-2, you can acquire <strong>Doctor Doom</strong> through Epic Quest: Ruler of Latveria.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num4.png\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-fareast-language: JA;\">As a Native Tier-2 Character, Doctor Doom has a lot of potential.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Cambria Math','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Cambria Math'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #ff6c00; mso-fareast-language: JA;\">Epic Quest Collection Added</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">A new Epic Quest feature has been added! Epic Quest Collection features collectibles you can get by playing Sorcerer Supreme, Rise of the X-Men, X-Force and our newest, First Family.<br>\nYou can get bonus rewards by just playing the Epic Quest!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Epic Quest Collection feature can be accessed by pressing a button located at the top right of each Epic Quest main screen.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">[Sorcerer Supreme]</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num5.png\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">[Rise of the X-Men]</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num6.png\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">[X-Force]</span></strong></span>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num7.png\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">[First Family]</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num8.png\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Collectibles are acquired by clearing stages in Epic Quests, and has a fixed probability to drop. Once you have acquired a certain number of collectibles, you can complete the collection and get the reward.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num9.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/082033/2num10.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1;\">- </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; color: #5b9bd5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-fareast-language: JA;\">Clear Epic Quests, collect collectibles and earn additional rewards!</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We hope you enjoy the various improvements and new characters brought to MARVEL Future Fight in the first update of 2019!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/puble/community/GAME/futurefight_en/2196/2018/11/27/1543305634499.jpg\"></p>\n"
